---
title: Customer quote
description: Present approved line items and payment terms to a customer.
schema:
  LineItem:
    description: string
    quantity: number
    unitPrice: ["string", "@", { description: "Formatted amount from the quoting system." }]
    total: ["string", "@", { description: "Approved line total, including quantity." }]
  Invoice:
    kind: "'invoice'"
    dueDays: number
  Prepaid:
    kind: "'prepaid'"
    paymentUrl: string.url
  Quote:
    number: string
    supplier: string
    customer: string
    validUntil: string
    items: LineItem[]
    total: string
    payment: Invoice | Prepaid
    assumptions: string[]
input: Quote
---
# Quote {number}

| Detail | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Supplier | {supplier} |
| Customer | {customer} |
| Valid until | {validUntil} |

## Scope and pricing

| Item | Quantity | Unit price | Total |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
<$each items={items} as="item">
  | {item.description} | {item.quantity} | {item.unitPrice} | {item.total} |
</$each>

**Total: {total}**

## Payment

<$match value={payment}>
  <$case type="Invoice">
    Payment is due within {payment.dueDays} days of the invoice date.
  </$case>
  <$case type="Prepaid">
    [Pay securely]({payment.paymentUrl}) to confirm the booking.
    Work is scheduled after payment is received.
  </$case>
</$match>
<$show if={assumptions.length > 0}>

  ## Scope assumptions

  <$each items={assumptions} as="assumption">
    - {assumption}
  </$each>
</$show>
